# Hooplings - Cursor configuration

Read `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root first; it holds the commands, hard rules and
the index of `docs/` files for every subsystem. Path-scoped rules live in
`.claude/rules/` (`backend.md`, `mobile.md`, `maestro.md`, `infra.md`) and
apply when you work under the matching directory. Those files are the only
agent instructions for this repository; do not add rules here.
